			"doc": "A dark thought: a small black cloud that drifts a repeating path and kills on contact. The point you place is the CENTRE of that path — it swings Amplitude px either side of here, or orbits here at Amplitude radius when Motion is Circle. Not resizable: it is 16x16.",
